{
"'Join me!' he said.": "他说：「随我来！」",
"'Let us reunite atop the Altai Mountains!\" he said.": "他说：「让我们在阿尔泰山上再会合！」",
"'We used to be people who had their own khagan. Where is our khagan now? To which khagan are we giving our services?' they said.": "他们说：「我们本是有自己可汗的百姓。如今我们的可汗何在？我们又在为哪一位可汗效力？」",
"'What (else) shall I say to you?' he said.": "他说：「我还能对你们说什么呢？」",
"(My father, the Khagan), profoundly glorified and praised the Turkic lords and people.": "（我父可汗）深深褒扬称颂突厥的诸匐与百姓。",
"(My father, the khagan), profoundly glorified and praised the Turkic lords and people.": "（我父可汗）深深褒扬称颂突厥的诸匐与百姓。",
"(Of you), those who survived there, utterly exhausted, were marching in every direction.": "（你们当中）在那里幸存下来的人，力竭至极，四散奔走。",
"(Of you,) those who survived there, utterly exhausted, were marching in all directions.": "（你们当中）在那里幸存下来的人，力竭至极，四散奔走。",
"(Then) I ordered them to ascend upward on foot, towing the horses after them, and holding onto the trees.": "（于是）我命他们徒步而上，牵马随行，攀树而进。",
"(Therefore) you, Chinese, attack them from the south, and you, Khitan, attack them from the east, and I shall attack them from the north.": "（因此）你们汉人自南面攻之，你们契丹自东面攻之，我则自北面攻之。",
"(They) held my father Ilterish Khagan and my mother El Bilga Khatun at the top of heaven and raised them upwards.": "（上天）将我父颉跌利施可汗与我母一利毗伽可敦擎于天顶，举而升之。",
"(Thus) we attacked and plundered (their camp).": "（于是）我们进击并劫掠了（他们的营地）。",
"(literally, “ […] his heavenly favor [they] did not curse.”)": "（直译：「……他们未曾诅咒他所受的天佑。」）",
"-less": "无……的",
"-less; a suffix denoting the lack of something": "表「无……」的后缀。",
"...(they) held my father, Ilterish Khagan, and my mother, El Bilga Khatun, on top of heaven's hill and raised them upwards.": "……（上天）将我父颉跌利施可汗与我母一利毗伽可敦擎于天丘之上，举而升之。",
"...Arabs, Tocharians...": "……大食人、吐火罗人……",
"...Having feared the Arabic tribes and Tocharians...": "……既已畏惧大食诸部与吐火罗人……",
"...Prince Kül's gold and silver, his treasures and possessions...": "……阙特勤的金银、财宝与产业……",
"...Thirty Tatars, Khitans, Tatabi...": "……三十姓鞑靼、契丹、奚……",
"...a few of the people had fled...": "……有少数百姓逃散……",
"...and blue squirrels I gained for my Turkic people.": "……我为我突厥百姓取得了青鼠皮。",
"...and fell upon the Kyrgyz people while they were asleep.": "……趁黠戛斯人熟睡时袭之。",
"...and he had said that the Turkic people were in disorder.": "……他曾说突厥百姓已陷于紊乱。",
"...and how you would (otherwise) perish by making mistakes, this, too I have recorded here.": "……而你们如何会因失误而覆亡，此事我亦记于此。",
"...and since envy touched their galls...": "……又因妒意侵其肺腑……",
"...at the Year of Dragon...": "……于龙年……",
"...for the sake of the Turkic people, I did not sleep by night and I did not relax by day.": "……为突厥百姓之故，我夜不成寐，昼不得安。",
"...he campaigned all the way to the emperor of the Goguryeo Empire...": "……他一直征伐至高句丽之王……",
"...heavy stones and thick wood...": "……沉重的石料与粗大的木材……",
"...it was Bars Bek.": "……那是巴尔斯匐。",
"...my people who have not been seen by eye and have not been heard by ear...": "……我那目所未见、耳所未闻的百姓……",
"...my relatives, my common Tölberi people, my Külik relatives, ownerless Elišim man, Ögüš man, Oγulan man, my sons in law, my daughters in law, I couldn't stay.": "……我的亲族、我的托勒别里众庶、我的库力克亲族，无主的埃利希姆人、厄居什人、奥古兰人，我的诸婿、我的诸媳——我不能久留了。",
"...or is there a lie in my word?": "……抑或我的话中有虚言？",
"...settled as far as the Iron Gate.": "……一直定居到铁门关。",
"...the soldiers of my father, the khagan, were like wolves and, his enemies were like sheep.": "……我父可汗的兵士如狼，其敌如羊。",
"...their lords fled.": "……他们的首领逃散。",
"...this many important rules...": "……如此众多的要则……",
"...under the presidency of the great general Li Quan, the father of ... came five hundred men.": "……以大将军李佺为首，……之父率五百人前来。",
"...your bones heaped up like a mountain.": "……你们的白骨堆积如山。",
