"After such people have settled close to them, they are said to plan their ill will there.": "据说这等人一旦迁居近旁，便在那里图谋不轨。",
"After they had numbered seven hundred men, (my father, the khagan), organized and ordered the people who had lost their state and khagan, the people that had turned into slaves and servants...": "待人数满七百之后，（我父可汗）整饬并统领那些失去国家与可汗、沦为奴仆的百姓……",
"Alternative form of 𐰜 (ök) after back vowels": "𐰜（ök）在后元音后的异体。",
"At his fourth fights at Bish-Balyk, Kul-Chur made sudden attacks (on the enemy) and disordered...": "在别失八里的第四战中，阙啜突袭（敌军）并使之溃乱……",
"At the age of sixteen, for the sake of the realm and laws of my uncle, the khagan, he accomplished the following:..": "十六岁时，为我叔父可汗的国家与法度，他成就了如下之事：……",
"At the age of thirty-eight, in winter, I went on a campaign against the Khitan Empire.": "三十八岁那年冬，我出征契丹。",
"At the age of thirty-nine, in spring, I went on a campaign against the Kumo Xi.": "三十九岁那年春，我出征库莫奚。",
"Bilge Khagan, a khagan of the Second Turkic Khaganate": "毗伽可汗，后突厥汗国可汗。",
"Bumin, the first khagan and the founder of the First Turkic Khaganate": "土门，突厥第一汗国的开国可汗。",
"China": "中国",
"Chor, a title": "啜（官号）",
"Deceiving by means of their sweet words and soft materials, they are said to cause the remote people to come close in this manner.": "据说他们以甘言与柔软的财物行骗，如此诱使远方的百姓迁居近旁。",
